[03/17 20:54:26     36s]     #-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
[03/17 20:54:26     36s]     # The FLOWTOOL_NUM_CPUS is an environment variable which should be exported by
[03/17 20:54:26     36s]     # the specified dist script.  This connects the number of CPUs being reserved
